r I know I have to call someone. I wish I could be more like my friend Mike. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>:\t\tHave you asked him for advice? It feels like you could learn a lot from him.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tHe's been giving me pointers, of course. I guess I'm just a boring nerd.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>:\t\tDon't say that! You're special in your own way. I wish someone realized that.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:\t\tThanks. Maybe I should just get over the whole dating thing ..."}]}}], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}